<urn:atm:triage:finding/BA4-QA1-002>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "BA4-QA1-002" ;
  triage:title "BA.4 sprint doc's 4 named CLI-level integration test files for the atm task command bodies do not exist" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr QA-1 (req-qa ATM-QA-001), PR #1408 @ 5ab184d75, https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1408#issuecomment-5642703785. The sprint doc names four dedicated CLI-level integration test files (crates/atm/tests/task_close.rs, task_assign.rs, task_move.rs, and an implied list/events integration file) covering 19 of the 30 named tests. None of those files exist. The 30 named tests all exist by name, but 19 were instead implemented as lower-layer unit tests directly against SqliteStorageBackend (atm-storage-rusqlite/tests/task_identity.rs) or pure query-selection functions (atm-core/src/task_query.rs), none of which exercise TaskCloseCommand::run, TaskAssignCommand::run, TaskListCommand::run, or TaskEventsCommand::run. fenix's ruling (https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1408#issuecomment-5642738654): STANDS, blocking, no re-scope -- required fix BA4-FIX-R1 (solar)." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-ba" ;
